，導致事故發生。（X截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250827/1037414640684371968045971.jpeg/2B4RfGvpyVVs1uZi1VH3QzP3pdxDfNgKxWhWkcVoVpE\"/><figcaption>事發後，當地居民紛紛出面表示，這個平交道的等待空間設計本來就有問題，如果不是像當地人熟知路況，就很容易站錯位置，導致事故發生。（X截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>偷情15年遭滅口！印度人妻被情夫砸頭「電暖器毀屍」　女兒回家嚇傻</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.372093+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1722,"images":18,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:00:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T17:18:03.394338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:03.429954+00:00","content_hash":"a41de145809741c7f8496aca933ae0eb3b5c4407042c0d38c4ea23735d43c748","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}